OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FWindy with occasional showers
OL,6,Facross Shetland this morning, Orkney
OL,7,Fmainly dry and bright. Bright or sunny
OL,8,Fspells this afternoon with winds
OL,9,Feasing across Shetland and showers
OL,10,Fdying out.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA fine end to the day with
OL,13,Fwell broken cloud, some clear spells
OL,14,Fpossible. Outbreaks of rain reaching
OL,15,FOrkney overnight and perhaps Shetland
OL,16,Fby dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
