OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FRain, heavy and times during
OL,6,Fthe morning, but drier and brighter
OL,7,Fconditions soon reaching Orkney. These
OL,8,Fdrier and brighter conditions then
OL,9,Fpushing into Shetland in the
OL,10,Fafternoon. Showers later.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FWindy
OL,13,Fwith showers on Friday and Saturday,
OL,14,Fstrong westerly winds at times. Bright
OL,15,Fwith occasional sunny spells. Rain
OL,16,Fpushing north on Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
